'' T49, RUN: a virtual property dispatches. LowerPropertyGet_ and LowerPropertySet_ called
'' the accessor the resolver bound -- the static type's -- directly, so 'pa->P' through an
'' A ptr on a B returned A's value and the setter stored A's way, while the vtable beside
'' them held B's. They now ask VirtualSlotOf_, as a method call does. Output identical to
'' fbc-modern's; the previous compiler differed on four of the five lines.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/virtual-property.bas -o tests/codegen/virtualproperty.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/virtualproperty.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/virtualproperty.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: A ptr on B: 3 200 B
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: setter via A ptr stored: 70
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: byref A: 3 300 B | P=3 Name=B
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: A ptr on C: 30 200  B ptr on C: 30 200
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: plain A: 1 2 A
